{"id":1748764,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-14T12:04:19.474Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1748764,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Terbaik Dariku","overview":"# The story follows a woman caught between her dream of having her husband's love and accepting the reality that her husband loves another woman. Aisyah marries Taufiq believing her husband is sincere towards her. In truth, Taufiq never loved Aisyah. Instead, Taufiq only uses Aisyah at the insistence of his mother, Saodah, who wants to enjoy the comfort and wealth that Aisyah possesses. In secret, Taufiq has another wife named Suraya (Azar Azmi) whom he married a month after his marriage to Aisyah. Taufiq is clever at hiding this marriage so that Aisyah cannot directly discover it. Taufiq often speaks ill of Aisyah in front of Suraya. He constantly complains that he is unhappy with Aisyah and how he tries to take care of Aisyah's feelings, but Aisyah does not respect him as a husband. Instead, he claims that Aisyah belittles him as a man who comes from a poor village. All these fabricated stories cause Suraya to hate Aisyah.","popularity":0.0071,"poster_path":"/g1slOmY2PVpdItJCyGJLzExU2Wr.jpg","production_companies":[],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2018-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Terbaik Dariku","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":1759537,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Syazuwan Hassan","original_name":"Syazuwan Hassan","popularity":0.6592,"profile_path":null,"cast_id":2,"character":"","credit_id":"6a7ddab5479ed3d5b15f8608","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":1551059,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Zara Zya","original_name":"Zara Zya","popularity":0.7888,"profile_path":"